{"seq":45,"slug":"feedback-performance-management","title":"反馈与绩效管理","stage":"DONE","category":"management","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management","rating":{"composite":4.43,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 反馈与绩效管理\n\n反馈与绩效管理是工程管理者最核心的日常杠杆——它决定团队成员能否获得清晰的方向信号、能否在正确的时间点修正行为、能否将个人成长与组织目标对齐。2026 年 Lattice《State of People Strategy》报告显示，绩效管理首次超越员工敬业度成为 HR 团队的首要优先级（40% vs 39%），而 AI 辅助反馈工具正在将管理者的评估撰写工作量减少 60%。这些趋势意味着：掌握反馈与绩效管理的底层逻辑，比以往任何时候都更具杠杆效应。\n\n本 hub 从四个维度构建完整的反馈与绩效管理知识体系：反馈基础能力、一对一对话机制、绩效周期运营、以及成长发展闭环。每个维度既可独立学习，也构成一条从\"日常反馈技能\"到\"系统性绩效运营\"的渐进路径。\n\n**推荐学习路径：**\n\n1. 先从「反馈基础」建立模型认知与交付能力——理解 SBI、Radical Candor 等框架\n2. 进入「一对一与持续反馈」学习将反馈嵌入日常管理节奏的方法\n3. 掌握「绩效周期」中的目标设定、评估撰写与校准流程\n4. 最后通过「成长与发展」将绩效结果转化为职业发展行动\n\n**前置知识：** 建议先了解基础管理概念（见 [engineering-management](../01_engineering-management/_INTRODUCTION.md)）和沟通技巧（见 [interpersonal-communication](../06_interpersonal-communication/_INTRODUCTION.md)）。\n\n**与相邻 hub 的分工边界：**\n\n- **engineering-management**：覆盖工程管理全景（团队建设、技术决策、流程设计等），本 hub 专注其中\"反馈与绩效\"这一垂直切面，提供更深的操作细节\n- **career-advancement**：从个人视角讨论如何规划职业路径、获得晋升，本 hub 从管理者视角讨论如何设计他人的成长路径与绩效体系\n- **leadership-coaching**：聚焦教练方法论（提问、引导、赋能），本 hub 聚焦反馈交付与绩效制度运营，两者在一对一场景有交集但侧重不同\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feedback-fundamentals","title":"反馈基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feedback-models-frameworks","title":"反馈模型与框架","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals/feedback-models-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"giving-receiving-feedback","title":"给予与接收反馈的实战技术","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals/giving-receiving-feedback"},{"seq":3,"slug":"radical-candor-practice","title":"极度坦诚实践","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/feedback-fundamentals/radical-candor-practice"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"one-on-one","title":"一对一与持续反馈","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"one-on-one-structure","title":"一对一会议结构","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one/one-on-one-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"continuous-feedback-culture","title":"持续反馈文化","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one/continuous-feedback-culture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"difficult-conversations","title":"困难对话处理","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/one-on-one/difficult-conversations"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-cycle","title":"绩效周期","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"goal-setting-okr-alignment","title":"目标设定与 OKR 对齐","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle/goal-setting-okr-alignment"},{"seq":2,"slug":"performance-review-writing","title":"绩效评估撰写","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle/performance-review-writing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"calibration-fairness","title":"校准与公平性","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/performance-cycle/calibration-fairness"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"growth-development","title":"成长与发展","docCount":3,"url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"career-development-planning","title":"职业发展规划","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development/career-development-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pip-improvement-plans","title":"绩效改进计划","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development/pip-improvement-plans"},{"seq":3,"slug":"recognition-motivation","title":"认可与激励体系","url":"/h/management/feedback-performance-management/growth-development/recognition-motivation"}]}]}